{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624800/extras/150a0624852aaca7611e8d81c6cecc17.avif?t=1753810616\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Momenta is an endless arcade game in which you will unlock new powers as you drive deeper into space.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Orbs, gain Momentum, and Charge your star power to unlock new abilities. Speed through space, magnetize collectables, and go for the high score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist art and music will relax you into a Tetris like trance as you chase the leaderboards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect more stars to unlock new abilities or more speed multipliers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete endless missions to unlock even more star power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your star into a shooting star!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624800/extras/e9d61538f4764f419eb9e0c31d706426.avif?t=1753810616\" width=800 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624800?t=1753810616","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624800/a45d8989235c14f01dd554a8886df7c7629f8f2c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753810616","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624800/2973d3ba832e8f1f06dfbf4b196deb58c8494e22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753810616","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea